  "rulesText": "Fear is as good as respect. You may count each **wanted level** as if it were **turf**.",
  "commentary": "The maximum **wanted level** is 4. Regardless of how much turf you hold (from this ability or otherwise) the minimum **rep** cost to advance your Tier is always 6.*",
